<mxCell id="p0b44" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:22.0px&quot;&gt;동작&lt;br&gt;· 버킷 표를 고정해 두고 빠진 멤버 칸만 다시 채움&lt;br&gt;· 설정 : hardware profile ecmp resilient (모델 · 버전 확인)&lt;br&gt;· export-gateway-ip 와 함께 쓰면 노드 단위 ECMP 에도 적용&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFE3C6;strokeColor=#D4A941;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=17.0;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="512" width="620" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
